ASM
================================================================================

The package com.codename1.tools.translator.classfile (and its analysis and tree
subpackages) in vm/ByteCodeTranslator is a rewrite of parts of ASM
(https://asm.ow2.io), the Java bytecode framework ParparVM's translator used to
read class files. It keeps ASM's API and design -- the visitor interfaces, the
instruction tree, the frame analyzer and its interpreters -- reduced to what the
translator uses, so the translator no longer depends on ASM and can translate
itself. The original copyright and license notice is retained in each source
file.

